<Legal
  title="Privacy Policy · Good Circles"
  description="How Good Circles collects, uses, and protects your information — plain-English privacy policy for the community marketplace."
  path="/privacy"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  updated="June 12, 2026"
>
  <p>
    Good Circles ("we," "us") operates goodcircles.org, a community marketplace launching in
    September 2026. This policy explains what information we collect before and after launch, how
    we use it, and the choices you have. The short version: we collect only what we need to run
    the circle, and <strong>we never sell your data</strong>.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Waitlist signups:</strong> your email address, your role (neighbor, merchant, nonprofit, CDFI, or municipal partner), and optionally your ZIP code or city.</li>
    <li><strong>Business and nonprofit signups:</strong> the organization details you provide, such as business name, website, category, organization name, or EIN.</li>
    <li><strong>Funnel metadata:</strong> the page that referred you and basic campaign tags (UTM parameters), used to understand how people find us.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To hold your founding spot and email you about the launch. We send sparingly — you can unsubscribe from any email.</li>
    <li>To prioritize where Good Circles launches next, using ZIP codes and city requests in aggregate.</li>
    <li>To verify nonprofits against IRS public records before they can receive funding.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How information moves inside the circle</h2>
  <p>
    Good Circles is a community: after launch, relevant information is shared with the nonprofit
    you elect and the merchants you shop with — that's how the model works. No personal data is
    sold or shared outside the platform for advertising or any other purpose.
  </p>

  <h2>Service providers</h2>
  <p>
    We use a small number of providers to operate the site: web hosting, our application backend,
    and a transactional email service. Each processes data only on our instructions. If analytics
    are enabled on this site, they are used in aggregate to improve it.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Unsubscribe from emails at any time via the link in every message.</li>
    <li>Request a copy of your data or ask us to delete it by emailing <a href="mailto:hello@goodcircles.org">hello@goodcircles.org</a>.</li>
    <li>We keep waitlist data only as long as needed to operate the launch and the marketplace.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>Good Circles is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    If this policy changes, we'll update the date at the top of this page and, for material
    changes, note it in our next email to the waitlist.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:hello@goodcircles.org">hello@goodcircles.org</a>.</p>
</Legal>
